  "notes": {
   "linuxserver": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-tautulli/compare/develop-463b4279-ls5...develop-799a5f6f-ls6",
   "upstream": "Escape session fields in the get_activity output\n\nThe dashboard update tick builds the subtitle decision from the PMS\nsubtitle language and writes it with .html(). The endpoint returned\nthe session fields raw. A session whose subtitle language carries\nmarkup executes for anyone who has the dashboard open. Apply the\nsame @sanitize_out() the sibling endpoints already use. The track\ncard titles and the raw stream info modal read the same fields with\n.text(). Switch those to .html() so escaped entities still render.\nPin the escaping in a regression test.\n\nCloses GHSA-33vr-q476-8wgg.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
   "upstream_url": "https://github.com/Tautulli/Tautulli/commit/799a5f6f38d4a8ce0c58cfcdb6969fcb0d6daaa0"
  },
